      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "problem: how we do score these *at scale* (automatically)?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "problem: how we do score these *at scale* (automatically)?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "Qcf2r7ZmB3OmpJnuiKOQi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2783.5716598516065,
      "y": 9446.292996278858,
      "width": 1149.2094317672206,
      "height": 680.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1924523087,
      "version": 1402,
      "versionNonce": 1103013057,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764868768085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Naive approach:\nRun RL as usual, of 1,000 updates of 1,000 prompts of 1,000 rollouts.\n(cost: 1,000,000,000 scores from humans)\n\nRLHF approach:\nSTEP 1:\nTake 1,000 prompts, get 5 rollouts, order them from best to worst\n(cost: 5,000 scores from humans)\nSTEP 2:\nTrain a neural net  simulator of human preferences (\"reward model\")\nSTEP 3:\nRun RL as usual, but using the simulator instead of actual humans\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Naive approach:\nRun RL as usual, of 1,000 updates of 1,000 prompts of 1,000 rollouts.\n(cost: 1,000,000,000 scores from humans)\n\nRLHF approach:\nSTEP 1:\nTake 1,000 prompts, get 5 rollouts, order them from best to worst\n(cost: 5,000 scores from humans)\nSTEP 2:\nTrain a neural net  simulator of human preferences (\"reward model\")\nSTEP 3:\nRun RL as usual, but using the simulator instead of actual humans\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
